    "Stage-mode fences alter overlap: its full-step time describes synchronized execution. Use pipeline mode for end-to-end performance; its unfenced training API times cannot rank device-complete module performance. Do not mix the two modes.",
    "Repeat both modes in alternating order with warmed caches; a single run does not establish variability."
